            "heading": "Main benefits",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "icon": "smoothie",
            "no_padding": true,
            "content": "<p>Use this space to outline the main benefits of your product. Highlight what makes it unique and valuable, such as key features, advantages over competitors, and how it can improve the customer's life or solve their problems. Clearly and concisely showcase why this product is a great choice.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
