            "icon": "none",
            "no_padding": true,
            "content": "<p>Use this space to provide detailed information about your product. Highlight its key features, benefits, and any unique qualities that set it apart. You can share tips on how to use the product, offer care instructions, or even tell a story about its creation to engage customers and help them make informed purchasing decisions.</p>",
